# The applied-prefix tracker records an own append whose apply failed: the offset
# reaches the tracker but the projection never holds it. The live advance then
# passes the activation's own durable entry.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestTrackerCountsFailedApply
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an own append is recorded by the tracker without being applied
PERTURBS: Land

--- FIND
       THEN /\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![author[o]] = @ \cup {o}]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the apply fails, but the tracker records the offset.
       THEN /\ cache' = cache
--- END
